@startuml
|Student/Alumni|
start
:Open profile; enter institution, programme, country and admission;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check session, role, fields and references;
if (Valid input and references?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Persist Draft record and admission history; confirm;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show field or permission error;
endif
stop
@enduml
